// The gopeed fork leaves BitTorrent and eD2k out of pkg/download, so their
// libraries stay out of this module, locks a task's connection list while the
// task is saved, spreads a ranged download over mirror URLs, reads a file of a
// running task, reads a link that answers once from its resolve response, and
// starts a download restored from a saved task without a ten second wait:
// https://github.com/junkerderprovinz/gopeed/tree/knightloader
replace github.com/GopeedLab/gopeed => github.com/junkerderprovinz/gopeed v0.0.0-20261114165838-d7e4c5d8e23c
